lines += ["","The generated matrix audits home and financing for all 17 trades × four Looks at 1440/768/390, plus the three Samples. It includes whole-page text, controls, focus, primary actions, review aggregate/filter behavior, images, overflow, process artwork and hero/rail geometry. Six extra normal-motion and six JS-off Sample states verify the exact saved heading, visible poster and static output. CLS is measured with a PerformanceObserver in JavaScript-enabled states; it is explicitly unmeasured, not reported as zero, in JS-off states.","","The accepted variant render/filter/parity/browser assertions remain intact. The existing generation browser test changes one obsolete expectation: the first explicit regeneration adopts the unlocked composition, while repeated regeneration with the same saved seed must now preserve every manifest choice. Lock, privacy, error/retry and save assertions remain unchanged. The new visible-heading check compares exact DOM text and visibility separately because CSS text-transform legitimately uppercases the display.","","The legacy suite redirects captures to this ticket, restores its temporary Pending-film fixture and rebuilds the final catalog. It retains the existing narrow platform console matcher: no new exception was added. The optional legacy console capture also records public negative fixtures/resource diagnostics outside that platform gate; these are retained as diagnostic data, not silently marked allowlisted. Platform-gated diagnostics have zero non-allowlisted errors. Browser page exceptions are zero. Provider adapters used for review fixtures are in-process mocks; external provider requests are blocked.","","Early exploratory contrast failures were fixed only in generated-site scope, then the full generated matrix was rerun. One initial Roofing acceptance measurement reported 4px overflow during normal motion; the complete final 102-command run passed the unchanged acceptance assertions. No behavior assertion or threshold was relaxed.","","### All 102 existing commands","","Commands run from `C:\\Users\\joe\\website_creator`. `node build.mjs` is the `npm run build` implementation; the typecheck invokes the same TypeScript config as `typecheck:client`. Each result and log is retained below.","","| # | Command | Result | Log |","|---:|---|---|---|"]
